---
// Which journal: four questions, asked in order, each with the journal it leads to. Inline SVG.
---
<figure class="diagram">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 760 330" role="img" aria-label="Choosing a journal: a test or throwaway run uses MemoryRunJournal; one host uses NdjsonRunJournal; a database you already run, or runs you query, uses SqlRunJournal; several machines with Redis workers use RedisRunJournal">
    <defs>
      <marker id="jc-ah" viewBox="0 0 8 8" refX="7" refY="4" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L8 4L0 8z" fill="#697080"/></marker>
    </defs>

    <g stroke="#14171f" stroke-width="1.2" fill="#fff">
      <rect x="10" y="10" width="340" height="52" rx="8"/>
      <rect x="10" y="94" width="340" height="52" rx="8"/>
      <rect x="10" y="178" width="340" height="52" rx="8"/>
      <rect x="10" y="262" width="340" height="52" rx="8"/>
    </g>
    <g stroke="#0e6b5c" stroke-width="1.2" fill="#e8f3f0">
      <rect x="430" y="10" width="320" height="52" rx="8"/>
      <rect x="430" y="94" width="320" height="52" rx="8"/>
      <rect x="430" y="178" width="320" height="52" rx="8"/>
      <rect x="430" y="262" width="320" height="52" rx="8"/>
    </g>

    <g font-size="14" font-weight="600" fill="#14171f">
      <text x="24" y="33">Is it a test, or may the run be lost?</text>
      <text x="24" y="117">Does everything run on one host?</text>
      <text x="24" y="201">Do you run a database already,</text>
      <text x="24" y="285">Do steps run on workers in a queue?</text>
    </g>
    <g font-size="12" fill="#697080">
      <text x="24" y="51">Nothing has to outlive the process.</text>
      <text x="24" y="135">One machine, one or more processes.</text>
      <text x="24" y="219">or need to query runs?</text>
      <text x="24" y="303">Several machines, Redis already there.</text>
    </g>

    <g font-size="14" font-weight="600" fill="#0e6b5c" text-anchor="middle">
      <text x="590" y="33">MemoryRunJournal</text>
      <text x="590" y="117">NdjsonRunJournal</text>
      <text x="590" y="201">SqlRunJournal</text>
      <text x="590" y="285">RedisRunJournal</text>
    </g>
    <g font-size="12" fill="#697080" text-anchor="middle">
      <text x="590" y="51">in core · gone when the process ends</text>
      <text x="590" y="135">in core · a file per run</text>
      <text x="590" y="219">agent-flow-sql · SQLite or Postgres</text>
      <text x="590" y="303">agent-flow-queue · shared Redis</text>
    </g>

    <g stroke="#697080" stroke-width="1.3" fill="none" marker-end="url(#jc-ah)">
      <path d="M350 36L428 36"/><path d="M350 120L428 120"/><path d="M350 204L428 204"/><path d="M350 288L428 288"/>
      <path d="M180 62L180 92"/><path d="M180 146L180 176"/><path d="M180 230L180 260"/>
    </g>
    <g font-size="12" fill="#697080" text-anchor="middle">
      <text x="389" y="29">yes</text><text x="389" y="113">yes</text><text x="389" y="197">yes</text><text x="389" y="281">yes</text>
    </g>
    <g font-size="12" fill="#697080">
      <text x="190" y="82">no</text><text x="190" y="166">no</text><text x="190" y="250">no</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>Ask the questions from the top. The first yes is your journal.</figcaption>
</figure>
